My apologies for not keeping up with the thread. I have no net
connection at home at the moment.

Anyway, you are correct, polymorph-and-wait is what I did. 

You can't put an ice box into a bag, but you can have one inside, and
you can take it out.

I'm not sure if this should be considered an abuse and fixed, since
all the nested containers will be empty. It does help for bringing
fridges to the demibar, I guess.

To fix it, you'd have to, when the thing reverts back, check if it can
be contained, and blow things up, in the case of nested bags of
holding (with the same probability as when puttting it in) or box
in-a-bag (always).

It can't be used to get a statue of demogorgon into a bag, because
statues just polymorph into different kinds of statues without
becoming hazy.

So, in the end, I'm not sure if this is abusable after all.

